<section class="page-hero section-shell centered"><p class="eyebrow">Learning plans</p><h1>Choose access that fits your next step.</h1><p>Pricing is stored in the platform configuration and shown in Nigerian naira. Checkout stays disabled until a Paystack key is configured and tested.</p></section>
<section class="section-shell plan-grid"><?php foreach ($plans as $plan): $benefits = json_decode($plan['benefits_json'] ?? '[]', true) ?: []; ?><article class="plan-card <?= $plan['slug'] === 'learner-monthly' ? 'featured' : '' ?>"><?php if ($plan['slug'] === 'learner-monthly'): ?><span class="plan-badge">Most focused</span><?php endif; ?><h2><?= e($plan['name']) ?></h2><p><?= e($plan['description']) ?></p><div class="price"><?php if ((int) $plan['amount_kobo'] === 0): ?><strong>Free</strong><?php else: ?><strong><?= money($plan['amount_kobo'], $plan['currency']) ?></strong><span>/ <?= $plan['interval_unit'] === 'annual' ? 'year' : 'month' ?></span><?php endif; ?></div><ul class="check-list"><?php foreach ($benefits as $benefit): ?><li><?= e($benefit) ?></li><?php endforeach; ?></ul><?php if ($plan['billing_type'] === 'free'): ?><a class="button button-outline" href="<?= $user ? route('courses') : route('register') ?>">Start free</a><?php elseif (!$user): ?><a class="button" href="<?= route('register') ?>">Create an account</a><?php elseif ($paymentReady): ?><form method="post" action="index.php"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="checkout"><input type="hidden" name="plan_id" value="<?= (int) $plan['id'] ?>"><input type="hidden" name="return_page" value="pricing"><button class="button" type="submit">Continue to secure checkout</button></form><?php else: ?><span class="button button-disabled">Test setup required</span><?php endif; ?></article><?php endforeach; ?></section>
<section class="section-shell payment-note"><h2>How payments are handled</h2><p>Payments are created and verified on the server. A browser callback never grants access by itself, and Paystack webhooks require a verified signature. The current installation is in safe test setup mode until credentials are added and tested.</p></section>
